			<div class="content" id="post-content-4235262">
									

<p>Big Edit: Thank you everyone for 200 votes! Expect more articles next month!</p>
<p>Image source: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Public_restroom_at_an_Iowa_rest_area.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Public_restroom_at_an_Iowa_rest_area.jpg</a></p>
<p>This file is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 4.0 International license.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;">Leveritas</a></span> for his crit. Thanks also to multiple users from #site19 and #thecritters for their help with this. If we traded drafts, let me know, and I'll link you here: <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/weryllium" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2727655); return false;">Weryllium</a></span> <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/deadly-bread" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3988532); return false;">Deadly Bread</a></span></p>
<p>After the positive feedback I received for my tale <a href="/a-fond-farewell">A Fond Farewell</a> I decided to push forward with one of my SCP ideas, and submit. I hope you enjoy!</p>
<p>P.S. Thank you to <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/laneous" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4894577); return false;">Laneous</a></span> for editing in the module, and correcting the title. My bad!<br />
P.P.S. Thank you to <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/henzoid" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5190300); return false;">Henzoid</a></span> for adding tags!</p>
<p>P.P.P.S. After a good deal of response here in the Discussions, I've decided to revise the core anomaly of SCP-4281. Same story, just no &quot;embarrassment effect&quot; or &quot;drone failure&quot; elements, which always felt the weakness of this article. Cheers to <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-great-hippo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3938622); return false;">The Great Hippo</a></span> for the suggestions.</p>
