<p>Thanks for the response! If you check the crit, and response from <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/themightymcb" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4483018); return false;">TheMightyMcB</a></span> above, you'll see I originally had a brief line about the interior of the stall being &quot;indescribable&quot;. I agreed that, compounded with the electronics failure and embarrassment effect, it was just throwing too many separate effects at the problem.</p>
